title: 'pallet-revive: enforce eth_subscribe log topic length like eth_getLogs'

doc:
- audience: Node Dev
  description: |-
    The `eth_subscribe` logs filter did not enforce go-ethereum's topic length rule: a `null`
    (or empty-set) wildcard position passed even when the log had no topic there, because the
    resolved filter was padded to a fixed length that could not distinguish an explicit `null`
    from an unspecified position. The filter now preserves its length, so a filter of length `N`
    only matches logs with at least `N` topics, matching go-ethereum and the `eth_getLogs`
    behaviour.

crates:
- name: pallet-revive-eth-rpc
  bump: patch
